# Paths this repository may track. check_tracked_paths.rb fails when a tracked
# file matches no line here, and when a line here matches no tracked file (so
# a stale line cannot quietly widen what is allowed).
#
# Lines are File.fnmatch globs with FNM_PATHNAME | FNM_DOTMATCH: `*` stays
# within one directory and also matches dotfiles, `**/` spans any depth.
# `{a,b}` is expanded by the checker before matching, and every alternative
# must match a tracked file.
# Prefer a place and a file type over a single file; name a single file only
# when it is the one file of its kind in that place. Markdown is always
# named, including documentation pages.
#
# Adding a line is a decision about what may be published: this repository
# is public, and the release build is made from a checkout of tracked files.

# --- Repository root --------------------------------------------------------
.gitignore
.ruby-version
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
ExportOptions.plist
LICENSE
README{,_ja}.md
Rakefile
VERSION
appcast.xml
project.yml

# --- Repository tooling -----------------------------------------------------
.github/FUNDING.yml
.github/workflows/*.yml
scripts/*.{sh,swift}
scripts/hooks/pre-push
scripts/lint/check_tracked_paths.rb
scripts/lint/tracked_paths.allow

# --- App sources and tests --------------------------------------------------
App/*.swift
Models/*.swift
Services/**/*.swift
Utilities/*.swift
Views/**/*.swift
Tests/*.swift

# --- App resources ----------------------------------------------------------
Resources/Info.plist
Resources/SpeechDock.entitlements
Resources/SpeechDock.sdef
Resources/*.lproj/{InfoPlist,Localizable}.strings
Resources/Assets.xcassets/Contents.json
Resources/Assets.xcassets/{AppIcon.appiconset,MenuBarIcon.imageset}/Contents.json
Resources/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/icon_*.png
Resources/Assets.xcassets/MenuBarIcon.imageset/menubar*.png

# --- README images ----------------------------------------------------------
assets/{logo,social-preview}.png

# --- Documentation site (GitHub Pages, Jekyll) ------------------------------
docs/{.ruby-version,Gemfile,Gemfile.lock,_config.yml,favicon.ico}
docs/_includes/head_custom.html
docs/_sass/custom/custom.scss
docs/{index,basics,advanced,applescript}{,_ja}.md
docs/images/*.png
docs/images/architecture.{drawio,svg}
